sequenceDiagram
    participant User as FinOps Engineer
    participant Console as Billing Console
    participant CE as Cost Explorer
    participant Anomaly as Anomaly Detection
    participant SNS as Amazon SNS
    
    User->>Console: Enable Cost Allocation Tags
    Console->>CE: Propagate Tags (24h delay)
    CE->>Anomaly: Feed Cost Data
    Anomaly->>Anomaly: Analyze via ML Model
    alt Spike Detected
        Anomaly->>SNS: Trigger Alert (JSON)
        SNS->>User: Email/Slack Notification
    end
    User->>CE: Investigate Root Cause
